WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.964
- They're American-made,
I mean, it's not--

00:00:01.964 --> 00:00:03.708
- Are they, though?

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:06.375
(intense music)

00:00:07.998 --> 00:00:09.081
- I'm a naturalized American.

00:00:09.081 --> 00:00:10.501
I moved here when I was like sixteen.

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:12.257
I feel like I missed out a little bit

00:00:12.257 --> 00:00:14.323
on the part where you're
supposed to get into Twinkies.

00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:16.899
- As a kid, my mom never let
me eat Twinkies. (laughs)

00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:19.282
She thinks Twinkies are the devil.

00:00:19.282 --> 00:00:21.674
- You hear the word Twinkie
all the time growing up,

00:00:21.674 --> 00:00:23.848
but I've never known anyone to eat it.

00:00:23.848 --> 00:00:25.034
- What if we really like it?

00:00:25.034 --> 00:00:25.867
- Let's do it!

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:27.709
- Alright, bring on the Twinkies.

00:00:27.709 --> 00:00:28.760
(wrapper rustling)

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:29.735
- Caught it.

00:00:29.735 --> 00:00:30.693
(clapping)

00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:32.752
- First of all, this logo is delightful.

00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:35.669
- Ooh, it's getting oil on my hand.

00:00:39.098 --> 00:00:40.641
- The cream kinda squirted in my mouth

00:00:40.641 --> 00:00:43.049
when I bit it, but I'm not mad at that.

00:00:43.049 --> 00:00:44.255
It was kind of refreshing.

00:00:44.255 --> 00:00:45.812
- This is better than I thought.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.966
- Oh, my God, I could
eat like 5,000 of these.

00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:50.252
- If I grew up eating
this, I'd be addicted.

00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:52.651
- I want another one.

00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:53.963
- What's the push-up count on this?

00:00:53.963 --> 00:00:55.312
- I don't know, but it
makes me wanna do a lot.

00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:56.145
- Mmm.

00:00:56.145 --> 00:00:57.069
- It's really good, though.

00:00:57.069 --> 00:00:58.401
- It's good. Yeah.

00:00:58.401 --> 00:01:00.113
- I don't think I'll ever eat one again.

00:01:00.113 --> 00:01:01.489
- Would I eat more than one of these?

00:01:01.489 --> 00:01:02.633
Yes.

00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:05.260
Would it give me a stomachache after?

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.783
- I just want cheese.

00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:09.855
- So we're gonna test the
durability of this Twinkie.

00:01:09.855 --> 00:01:12.369
(crashing)

00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:14.619
(laughing)

00:01:15.836 --> 00:01:18.669
(energetic music)

